There isnt a one size fits all solution<br><br>Everyone makes their codeplug slighly differently.<br><br>However a few key points are<br><br>OpenGD77 codeplugs support advanced features not available on other radios / firmware, because of supporting TalkGroup lists which greatly simplify the codeplug structure, so that you only need 1 channel per repeater.<br><br>Ignore any videos etc only for other radios, as their codeplugs will be much more complicated and confusing.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sat Nov 30, 2024 10:13 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
